## Project-specific ignores

# Regenerable outputs: ignore everything under artifacts/ except its README.
# A directory rule such as /artifacts/ would make re-including the README
# impossible.
/artifacts/*
!/artifacts/README.md

# Agent outputs: keep _agents_outputs/ tracked, ignore only the dump.
_agents_outputs/_agents_dump/

# Claude Code skill discovery link (recreate with .claude/setup-discovery.ps1 on
# Windows or .claude/setup-discovery.sh on Linux/macOS). No trailing slash: a
# Linux/macOS symlink is a file to Git, and "dir/" rules match directories only.
/.claude/skills

# Machine-local Claude Code settings (never commit):
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local credentials (never commit):
secrets/

# LaTeX build files (intermediates stay in each project's .latex_build/):
.latex_build/
publications/**/main.pdf
publications/**/*.log
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)
